<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta name="description" content="Lifin is a simple daily budget, expense, and income tracker for iPhone.">
  <title>Lifin — Everyday Budget & Expense Tracker</title>

  <style>
    :root {
      --background: #F6F9FC;
      --primary: #3B82F6;
      --primary-dark: #2563EB;
      --light-blue: #EAF2FF;
      --card: #FFFFFF;
      --text: #1F2937;
      --secondary: #6B7280;
      --divider: #E5EAF0;
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    html {
      scroll-behavior: smooth;
    }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family:
        -apple-system,
        BlinkMacSystemFont,
        "SF Pro Display",
        "SF Pro Text",
        "Segoe UI",
        sans-serif;
      background: var(--background);
      color: var(--text);
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    a {
      color: inherit;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .container {
      width: min(1080px, calc(100% - 40px));
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    header {
      height: 72px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
    }

    nav {
      width: 100%;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
    }

    .brand {
      font-size: 24px;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: -0.5px;
      color: var(--primary-dark);
    }

    .nav-link {
      color: var(--secondary);
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .hero {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 100px 0 110px;
    }

    .badge {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 7px 14px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: var(--light-blue);
      color: var(--primary-dark);
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 22px;
    }

    h1 {
      margin: 0 auto;
      max-width: 760px;
      font-size: clamp(44px, 8vw, 76px);
      line-height: 1.06;
      letter-spacing: -2.5px;
    }

    .hero p {
      max-width: 650px;
      margin: 26px auto 0;
      font-size: 19px;
      color: var(--secondary);
    }

    .hero-button {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      margin-top: 34px;
      padding: 14px 22px;
      border-radius: 14px;
      background: var(--primary);
      color: white;
      font-weight: 700;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.2);
    }

    section {
      padding: 70px 0;
    }

    .section-title {
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 42px;
    }

    .section-title h2 {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 36px;
      letter-spacing: -1px;
    }

    .section-title p {
      margin: 10px auto 0;
      max-width: 620px;
      color: var(--secondary);
    }

    .features {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 18px;
    }

    .feature {
      background: var(--card);
      border: 1px solid var(--divider);
      border-radius: 24px;
      padding: 28px;
      min-height: 210px;
    }

    .icon {
      width: 46px;
      height: 46px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      border-radius: 14px;
      background: var(--light-blue);
      font-size: 23px;
    }

    .feature h3 {
      margin: 0 0 8px;
      font-size: 18px;
    }

    .feature p {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--secondary);
      font-size: 15px;
    }

    .privacy-card {
      padding: 54px;
      border-radius: 30px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #EAF2FF, #FFFFFF);
      border: 1px solid var(--divider);
      text-align: center;
    }

    .privacy-card h2 {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 34px;
      letter-spacing: -1px;
    }

    .privacy-card p {
      max-width: 660px;
      margin: 16px auto 0;
      color: var(--secondary);
    }

    .privacy-link {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-top: 24px;
      color: var(--primary-dark);
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .languages {
      text-align: center;
    }

    .language-list {
      margin-top: 20px;
      color: var(--secondary);
      font-size: 16px;
    }

    footer {
      margin-top: 50px;
      padding: 34px 0;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--divider);
      color: var(--secondary);
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .footer-content {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 20px;
    }

    .footer-links {
      display: flex;
      gap: 20px;
    }

    @media (max-width: 800px) {
      .hero {
        padding: 70px 0 80px;
      }

      h1 {
        letter-spacing: -1.8px;
      }

      .features {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .privacy-card {
        padding: 38px 24px;
      }

      .footer-content {
        flex-direction: column;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
  <div class="container">
    <nav>
      <div class="brand">Lifin</div>
      <a class="nav-link"
         href="https://sehwani87-dev.github.io/lifin-privacy/"
         target="_blank"
         rel="noopener">
        Privacy
      </a>
    </nav>
  </div>
</header>

<main>

  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="badge">Life, organized.</div>

      <h1>Understand where your money goes.</h1>

      <p>
        Lifin is a simple everyday budget tracker for managing expenses,
        income, recurring payments, and monthly budgets — all in one place.
      </p>

      <div class="hero-button">
        Coming soon on the App Store
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>


  <section>
    <div class="container">

      <div class="section-title">
        <h2>Built for everyday money</h2>
        <p>
          Everything you need to keep track of your daily finances,
          without turning budgeting into a complicated task.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="features">

        <div class="feature">
          <div class="icon">💳</div>
          <h3>Budget your way</h3>
          <p>
            Set your budget amount, currency, and your own monthly budget cycle.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="feature">
          <div class="icon">🧾</div>
          <h3>Track expenses & income</h3>
          <p>
            Record spending and income with categories, dates,
            payment methods, notes, and more.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="feature">
          <div class="icon">🔁</div>
          <h3>Recurring records</h3>
          <p>
            Keep regular expenses and income such as rent,
            subscriptions, and salary organized automatically.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="feature">
          <div class="icon">📊</div>
          <h3>Understand your spending</h3>
          <p>
            Review category breakdowns and see the balance between
            fixed and variable spending.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="feature">
          <div class="icon">📍</div>
          <h3>See spending on the map</h3>
          <p>
            Save locations with expenses and see where your money
            was spent directly on the map.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="feature">
          <div class="icon">📄</div>
          <h3>Export your records</h3>
          <p>
            Export your expense data as CSV or create detailed
            Excel and PDF reports.
          </p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>


  <section>
    <div class="container">

      <div class="privacy-card">
        <h2>Your records stay with you.</h2>

        <p>
          Lifin does not require an account.
          Your budgets, expenses, income, photos, and saved locations
          are stored locally on your device.
        </p>

        <a
          class="privacy-link"
          href="https://sehwani87-dev.github.io/lifin-privacy/"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener">
          Read the Privacy Policy →
        </a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>


  <section class="languages">
    <div class="container">

      <div class="section-title">
        <h2>Made for more places</h2>
        <p>
          Lifin supports currencies from around the world and is available
          in 10 languages.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="language-list">
        English · 한국어 · 日本語 · 简体中文 · 繁體中文 · Français ·
        Español · Deutsch · Italiano · Português
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

</main>


<footer>
  <div class="container footer-content">

    <div>
      © 2026 Lifin. All rights reserved.
    </div>

    <div class="footer-links">
      <a href="https://sehwani87-dev.github.io/lifin-privacy/">
        Privacy Policy
      </a>
    </div>

  </div>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
